{"id":"angreifer","lemma":"Angreifer","pos":"noun","rank":4334,"glosses":["attacker (someone who attacks), assailant"],"ipa":"/ˈanˌɡʁaɪ̯fɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/De-Angreifer.ogg/De-Angreifer.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Angreifers","plural":"Angreifer"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie drängten die Angreifer zurück.","en":"They pushed back the attackers.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to push, press","l":"drängen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"stand back!"}]},{"text":"Er rang seinen Angreifer zu Boden.","en":"He wrestled his attacker to the ground.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"wrestling","l":"Ringen"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"ground, soil"}]},{"text":"Die Menschen erhoben sich gegen die Angreifer.","en":"The people rose up against the invaders.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"human","l":"Mensch"},{"g":"to raise, lift","l":"erheben"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Erinnern Sie sich noch, wie der Angreifer aussah?","en":"Do you remember what the attacker looked like?","words":[{"g":"to remind"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to look, seem","l":"aussehen"}]},{"text":"Tom identifizierte seinen Angreifer.","en":"Tom identified his assailant.","words":[null,{"g":"to identify","l":"identifizieren"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]}]}